  "page1": "Safety                                                          Reliability\nReliable protection delivered by the highly rigid overhead      Fully sealed aluminium component housings provide a\nguard. Superb stability due to the dynamic Linde Drive          superb protection from dust and dirt ingress. European\nAssist system, which provides safe operations at all times.     manufactured cutting edge drive and lift motors and contact-\n                                                                free hydraulic mini levers underline the premium standard\nPerformance                                                     of this electric truck.\nVery well known as electric trucks with IC truck performance,\nLinde electric trucks are delivered with powerful electric      Service\nmotors and an intelligent electronic control. These both        Four different battery changing solutions, maintenance free\ntogether form an impressive and compact powerpack to            AC motors and wet disc brakes are bringing the truck down\ndeliver a benchmarking productivity.                            time to a minimum to ensure the lowest service cost level\n                                                                possible. Easy and quick diagnosis is realized through the\nComfort                                                         Linde Digital Control System.\nA consistently high level of efficiency for extended working\nperiods is only possible with ergonomic design.\nThe ergonomic layout of all truck controls, an adjustable\narmrest with integrated mini levers, and the Twin Pedal\nlayout provide the optimum interface between the truck\nand its operator."
